{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: Constitution 17 or higher\n\nSurviving long battles at your limit have granted you an unbreakable will. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- After receiving damage in a single battle, equal to half of your maximum Hit Points, you can receive temporary hit points equal to that amount, remove any condition that causes you to be incapacitated, and gain the effects of the Haste spell until you finish the combat. After the effect ends you receive 2 exhaustion levels and are unable to use this feature until you finish a short or long rest.\n\n- Once per turn when you drop to 0 HP and don\u0027t die outright you can spend a single hit dice to instantly recover 1 HP and remain standing.","level":1}],"id":"Custom13253d38-156b-457b-994a-2b6e13b577a0","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Berseker Soul [SM] [LG]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}